{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_043kaz_2_1_2_043_12",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c2d668250a4aa3ac7c5b608978eec319a96b42ad61218b2d4ed39b61b7899071",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_043kaz_2_1_2_043_12:1_2_043_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75ee6b78cea05754105c4eb7f98f36173254ddf6770876b4ae0aef866e840bef",
      "text": "圣地巡礼为他而行",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_043kaz_2_1_2_043_12:1_2_043_12_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62819e24157b7b6a4afe30014effd5e1ae9945236f2b8df768ec45f5ce75d434",
      "text": "某个休息日，一希受到凉和大吾的邀请，\n希望他“能陪他们一天”。在完全不知道要去哪里的情况下，\n到达集合地点的一希从凉和大吾口中得知，\n他们要举办一场“一希先生限定巡礼”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_043kaz_2_1_2_043_12:1_2_043_12_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7c20798f29b9927e4176a6c819844573fe9463f10497f023593c3e60cfd1d05",
      "text": "一眨眼就到生日当天了呢！惊喜礼物的\n相册，一希先生会喜欢吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_043kaz_2_1_2_043_12:1_2_043_12_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:234653a5c49633adeefc2960f9295c16aa27aa3dd5f7a0f8878f1197370ff405",
      "text": "肯定会喜欢的啦！毕竟是把前阵子\n巡礼途中的照片整理在一起的特别定制款嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_043kaz_2_1_2_043_12:1_2_043_12_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c6092c7d076c2a2719d43c45ea86fe13f56bc0f2ebfb62690b9c26d817db6dd",
      "text": "也是呢！\n剩下的就只要决定在什么时机送出去了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_043kaz_2_1_2_043_12:1_2_043_12_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c165d10e6af860277ed8f74fd77ecf08d09061189361bd67eb8a6efe32e1ea4",
      "text": "肯定会点蛋糕的，\n等端上来的时候送怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_043kaz_2_1_2_043_12:1_2_043_12_a:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fad732104f7e14358c5a691acee2be55e870c8c9845695097baf1a78111b823",
      "text": "那敢情好啊！\n真期待老师会露出什么样的反应！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_043kaz_2_1_2_043_12:1_2_043_12_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d74fddd010070fb3e8630fd9086118f6f63fec66b3e657bdbb8233fb008b549",
      "text": "……凉也读了那本恐怖小说吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_043kaz_2_1_2_043_12:1_2_043_12_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd6abaefd5c12ef3874ca9c1be596f737e727474d53fd253578383c4c927cac4",
      "text": "为了这次活动去挑战了一下，但果然还是害怕，\n就让大吾君读给我听了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_043kaz_2_1_2_043_12:1_2_043_12_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46065eb95d74a07e9322e1f596da5053d71a0a3c26ce5196de9ed3a8c44a77eb",
      "text": "总有一天我也想自己亲自读完。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_043kaz_2_1_2_043_12:1_2_043_12_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2e8e89a82f96a5ef6e3c70cd04b58fb103110a181f07296411c687dbccd418c",
      "text": "……应付不来的东西，不用勉强。\n为了我而去尝试挑战的心意，我很开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_043kaz_2_1_2_043_12:1_2_043_12_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42e64f47ae55b6e7f72f73722830b34bec058ea60faeffe677f33c5eebf16a92",
      "text": "读自己想读的书才是最好的。……下次，\n我带一本凉可能会喜欢的小说来吧。愿意读读看吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_043kaz_2_1_2_043_12:1_2_043_12_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:617b06e8d40fe0928ee2bf4493b5d539be057be77ad1c130795b0f4491d30d3a",
      "text": "可以吗？非常感谢。\n我很期待哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_043kaz_2_1_2_043_12:1_2_043_12_c:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:891413eac546b861057caddaa634c04263a3c581346468c58d2be7607bf8843b",
      "text": "……那本旅行手册里，穿插了\n各种各样小说的构思细节呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_043kaz_2_1_2_043_12:1_2_043_12_c:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5b8143a4b8d10d6453af19b9f1c260d76d3f9418e57a4e1040fadf56f5ef4a1",
      "text": "你注意到了吗！那可是俺们两个的心血之作嘛！\n各处细节都相当讲究哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_043kaz_2_1_2_043_12:1_2_043_12_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76940a2303270b5907869119e7b9267965fba349b5774d779b34e3161d6e74f8",
      "text": "能被你发现真是太开心了！\n因为俺自己也特别中意，所以好好收起来了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_043kaz_2_1_2_043_12:1_2_043_12_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55d725469f1825bfc66b915c93b3030be9ec2ffbf1a7766e0b6cb5272648d36c",
      "text": "……我也是。\n放在随时都能拿出来的地方，好好珍藏着。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_043kaz_2_1_2_043_12:1_2_043_12_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6aeb71d1e4b8a7edd1eb95c3ed0ee7708d0f4f8a282f55e0245a0412ed924444",
      "text": "……只要看着手册，就能\n回想起那次巡礼呢。真的很谢谢你们。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
